      "run": 2,
      "country": "Asgard",
      "sector": "Maize",
      "kind": "calculation",
      "statement": "Asgard has lost 56.3% of its maize imports from Orvan (September, October, November, December vs a year earlier); following Odin's remand, Heimdall's search confirmed no substitute maize supply is on the record. Thor maintains 56.0-56.3% of the total import basket as the unmitigated baseline loss. A spot-price premium of 12% is separately observed.",
      "estimate": {
        "low": 55.97,
        "high": 56.34,
        "unit": "pct_total_import_basket",
        "metric": "Value loss as % of total baseline import basket (same disruption months, year-on-year)",
        "baseline": "same months of 2025"
      },
      "nature": "INFERENCE",
      "reasoning": "Maintained in Run 2 at 56.0-56.3%: Heimdall's remand search confirmed no substitute trade series exists for Asgard Maize; with primary disruption unmitigated, position remains unchanged; low = net_import_loss_pct, high = gross_import_loss_pct (both / total import basket); the 12% spot premium is separately cited.",
